blocks.en:
TABLE IV: Quantitative comparison of depth-estimation methods.
Within each method block, the best value per column, except Density,
is in bold and the second-best distinct value is underlined;
The Align column indicates whether per-frame affine depth alignment
is applied before evaluation.
In method labels, K denotes camera intrinsics
and P denotes camera poses;
The Filter column identifies confidence-P50 masking (P50)
or the range restriction ( ≤ 10 \leq 10 m);
a dash indicates that neither operation is applied.

blocks.zh:
表格 四:深度估计方法的定量比较.
在每个方法块内,每个列的最佳值,但密度除外,
以粗体表示,并下划线显示第二大独特价值;
对齐列表示是否每帧相近深度对齐
在评价前适用。
在方法标签中, K 表示相机内在
P表示相机姿势;
过滤列识别自信心- P50 掩码( P50)
或射程限制(- 10\leq 10米);
a 破折号表示没有操作。
